    "/api/comms/draft": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Comms Assistant"
        ],
        "summary": "Draft",
        "description": "Generates a draft. Never sends or publishes anything - see `apps/comms/draft.py`'s module\ndocstring for why \"nothing publishable without a recorded reviewer\" holds by construction.\n\nFailure mapping is deliberately specific, not a blanket 500:\n- `GatewayNotConfiguredError` / `RedactionNotConfiguredError` -> 503. Deployment configuration\n  is missing (no API key, or - per ADR-0006 - no approved `REDACTION_POLICY_PATH`). Expected,\n  correct refusal in any environment that hasn't been configured yet, not a bug to alert on\n  the same way as a real failure.\n- `GatewayCallError` -> 502. The provider call itself failed after a retry - genuinely down,\n  distinct from \"not configured\".",
        "operationId": "draft_api_comms_draft_post",
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/DraftIn"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/DraftOut"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Validation Error",
            "content": {
